# Defaults added to every ArduPilot SITL vehicle in `sim/run-sim.sh` (DRY-COVERAGE-PLAN.md Phase 11): the
# second serial port speaks MAVLink 2. The driver owns SERIAL0; the reference implementation (`pymavlink`)
# reads the same vehicle on SERIAL1, five TCP ports up, as the second opinion `live.py` holds every state
# against. Without this line SERIAL1 accepts a connection and says nothing. A default, not a write: it is the
# value the port would have on a flight controller whose second telemetry port is configured for a ground
# station.
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL1_BAUD 115
